        }
      ],
      "updated": 1782073914700,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Check Go server is running  \n   if yes : Kill Go server\n\n2. Check global-dataset.csv exists :\n   if no : call data-creator.py \n\n\n3. Run data-renew.py\n\n\n4. Check data-renew.csv exists : \n   \n    if yes then run-crawler as \n    separate process \n   \n    if new-data.py running :\n        yes : delete go-server\n        no  : run new-data.py as a\n              separate process\n\n5. Run renew-data-merge.py \n\n6. Delete data-renew.cvs\n\n7. Run Generic\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 37.42684061710297,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Check Go server is running  \n   if yes : Kill Go server\n\n2. Check global-dataset.csv exists :\n   if no : call data-creator.py \n\n\n3. Run data-renew.py\n\n\n4. Check data-renew.csv exists : \n   \n    if yes then run-crawler as \n    separate process \n   \n    if new-data.py running :\n        yes : delete go-server\n        no  : run new-data.py as a\n              separate process\n\n5. Run renew-data-merge.py \n\n6. Delete data-renew.cvs\n\n7. Run Generic\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
